   "narration": "Step one: M equals k times the square root of L1 L2. L1 times L2 is zero point one six, whose square root is zero point four, so M is zero point nine times zero point four, zero point three six henries. Step two: series aiding adds two M: zero point two plus zero point eight plus zero point seven two, one point seven two henries."
